{"id":"901cefb5db79b842","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-implication-axiom.md","title":"经典组合真理的蕴涵子句","display":"df-implication-axiom — 经典组合真理的蕴涵子句","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-implication-axiom","aliases":["91-df-implication-axiom","91-df-conditional-axiom"],"display":"df-implication-axiom — 经典组合真理的蕴涵子句","depends_on":["[[91-df-coded-syntax]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-implication-axiom"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-implication-axiom</span><span>91-df-conditional-axiom</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-implication-axiom — 经典组合真理的蕴涵子句"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"38c875c58a0bf84c\" href=\"?note=38c875c58a0bf84c\" title=\"91-df-coded-syntax\">91-df-coded-syntax</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 为基础语言或真理语言的句子编码谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{imp}(a,b)=\\operatorname{disj}(\\operatorname{neg}(a),b)\">\\(\\operatorname{imp}(a,b)=\\operatorname{disj}(\\operatorname{neg}(a),b)\\)</span> 是材料蕴涵编码。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{imp}}(D)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{imp}}(D)\\)</span> 为下述对象句，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{imp}\">\\(\\mathrm{imp}\\)</span> 是角色下标。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}implication\\text{-}axiom}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{imp}}(D)\\coloneqq\\forall a\\forall b\\,\n[D(\\operatorname{imp}(a,b))\\to(T(\\operatorname{imp}(a,b))\\leftrightarrow(T(a)\\to T(b)))].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}implication\\text{-}axiom}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{imp}}(D)\\coloneqq\\forall a\\forall b\\,\n[D(\\operatorname{imp}(a,b))\\to(T(\\operatorname{imp}(a,b))\\leftrightarrow(T(a)\\to T(b)))].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>同一域上的经典否定子句与析取子句共同推出本句，故 CT 的基础域及 FS 的真理语言域均满足它。\nKF 对任意真理语言句子只给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\operatorname{imp}(a,b))\\leftrightarrow(T(\\operatorname{neg}(a))\\lor T(b))\">\\(T(\\operatorname{imp}(a,b))\\leftrightarrow(T(\\operatorname{neg}(a))\\lor T(b))\\)</span>。不能以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg T(a)\">\\(\\neg T(a)\\)</span> 替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\operatorname{neg}(a))\">\\(T(\\operatorname{neg}(a))\\)</span>。加 CONS 可获得保持 modus ponens 的单向分配原则；这仍不等于完整材料蕴涵双条件。</p>\n<p>来源：Definitions 8.3、14.1、15.2；Lemma 15.18，印刷页 200。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-coded-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"38c875c58a0bf84c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-coded-syntax]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{imp}(a,b)=\\operatorname{disj}(\\operatorname{neg}(a),b)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{imp}}(D)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{imp}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}implication\\text{-}axiom}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{imp}}(D)\\coloneqq\\forall a\\forall b\\,\n[D(\\operatorname{imp}(a,b))\\to(T(\\operatorname{imp}(a,b))\\leftrightarrow(T(a)\\to T(b)))].","display":true},{"tex":"T(\\operatorname{imp}(a,b))\\leftrightarrow(T(\\operatorname{neg}(a))\\lor T(b))","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg T(a)","display":false},{"tex":"T(\\operatorname{neg}(a))","display":false}],"bytes":1361,"backlinks":[{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-59","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-implication-axiom]]"},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-33","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-implication-axiom]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-47","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-coded-syntax.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-axioms.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conjunction-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-conservative-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conservativity-proof.md]]\n[[91-df-consistency-predicate.md]]\n[[91-df-continuity.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-expressive-completeness.md]]\n[[91-df-external-consistency.md]]\n[[91-df-external-logic.md]]\n[[91-df-external-negation.md]]\n[[91-df-extrinsic-fixed-point.md]]\n[[91-df-fixed-point-model.md]]\n[[91-df-gap-sentence.md]]\n[[91-df-global-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-global-reflection.md]]\n[[91-df-ground-language.md]]\n[[91-df-ground-model.md]]\n[[91-df-hierarchical-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-hierarchy-of-truth-theories.md]]\n[[91-df-implication-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-induction-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-inner-outer-logic-difference.md]]\n[[91-df-internal-consistency.md]]\n[[91-df-internal-induction.md]]\n[[91-df-internal-logic.md]]\n[[91-df-internal-negation.md]]\n[[91-df-intrinsic-fixed-point.md]]\n[[91-df-iterative-construction.md]]\n[[91-df-jump-operator.md]]\n[[91-df-language-with-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-liar